Troubleshooting (fast)
•	VPN connects but RDP fails
o	NSG not allowing 3389 from VirtualNetwork? Fix rule.
o	Windows Defender Firewall blocking RDP? Ensure Remote Desktop inbound rules enabled.
o	Wrong private IP? Confirm in VM → Networking.
•	VPN won’t connect
o	Did you import the profile downloaded from the gateway?
o	Root .cer uploaded to gateway and client PFX installed on your PC?
o	P2S address pool (172.16.0.0/24) must not overlap with your home Wi-Fi subnet or the VNet.
•	Name resolution
o	Use IP for RDP unless you configured custom DNS.
